{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the depths of the moon in this classic-inspired grid-based dungeon crawling RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2070. A lunar mining operation picks up a mysterious signal emanating from the inside of the moon. Once the signal is discovered, all the automatons and electronic systems in the operation go haywire, killing a large portion of the base\u2019s inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A team of highly specialized operatives from all over the world are called in to investigate the disturbance and find the cause. What they discover through this journey into the unknown will change the course of human history. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they descend through the world inside the moon they are confronted with twisted reflections of civilization, structures, and mythology we know to be our own. Are they being tested, or punished for the nature of humanity? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will this descent take them, and what lies at the bottom? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/3587d52e4d9b742e25022b0f9d541b2a.poster.avif?t=1773145776\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/3587d52e4d9b742e25022b0f9d541b2a.webm?t=1773145776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/3587d52e4d9b742e25022b0f9d541b2a.mp4?t=1773145776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Dungeon Crawling</strong> - Investigate the moon in this classic inspired grid-based dungeon crawling RPG. Customize your party at the lunar base and explore the dungeons to find what lies in waiting beneath the surface.    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Your Perfect Team -</strong>\u00a0Customize your operatives' abilities, unlock new subclasses, change up your gear, and upgrade your characters to customize your play experience and tackle your enemies in a style that suits you.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive First-Person Exploration -\u00a0</strong>Travel through the world beneath the lunar surface and explore the dungeons to discover its secrets. Defeat powerful enemies to level up your team and gain access to new areas.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat Encounters -</strong>\u00a0Fight your way through enemy encounters with traditional first-person formation combat and tactical grid-based combat. Strategize your encounters to protect your team and get the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Check Your Sanity -</strong>\u00a0Be careful. The more time you spend in the dungeons, the less sanity you have which can lead to more volatile encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Strange Characters -</strong> Find and befriend allies or make enemies within each dungeon for access to more loot, rewards, and information that will aid in your exploration of new areas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/afbf3ab28617aadc5adf52c301f64875.poster.avif?t=1773145776\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/afbf3ab28617aadc5adf52c301f64875.webm?t=1773145776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/afbf3ab28617aadc5adf52c301f64875.mp4?t=1773145776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descent of Lunaris is a love letter to classic dungeon-crawling RPGs of the past. Descend into the depths and find the source of the signal that summoned your mission. Not everything is as it seems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to see what lies beneath?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/04a608358370da2d8510ed1862c50601.poster.avif?t=1773145776\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/04a608358370da2d8510ed1862c50601.webm?t=1773145776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/extras/04a608358370da2d8510ed1862c50601.mp4?t=1773145776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824720?t=1773145776","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824720?t=1773145776","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/40210c6e31bf945ecfe948dadf02c8458cd36586/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773145776","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824720/40210c6e31bf945ecfe948dadf02c8458cd36586/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773145776","categories":[{"description